---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import ContactForm from '../components/ContactForm.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Contact Finance Sikh about corrections or general website questions."><section class="wrap py-12"><div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr]"><div><p class="font-semibold text-teal">Contact Finance Sikh</p><h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold">Questions about the website?</h1><p class="mt-5 leading-7">Use the form to report a correction or ask a general question about Finance Sikh. Please include the article URL and the exact information you believe needs correction.</p><div class="mt-6 rounded-xl border border-[var(--color-line)] bg-white p-5"><h2 class="text-lg font-bold">Before you write</h2><ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700"><li>We cannot provide personalised investment, tax, insurance, legal, credit, or financial advice.</li><li>Messages are stored securely in Firebase Cloud Firestore and are not automatically emailed.</li><li>For a correction, include a reliable official source where possible.</li></ul></div><p class="mt-5 text-sm">You can also write to <strong>financesikh.learn@gmail.com</strong>.</p></div><div><ContactForm /></div></div></section></BaseLayout>
